  "hints": [
    "Leaving the pad starts a countdown. The elevator stops when it reaches zero, unless someone stands on the pad.",
    "Switch on LIFT-POWER, record and save an empty recording ({key:echo} twice), launch with {key:echo}, then walk right twice."
